Output features/thinking.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 700
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Dracula"
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/lunate-demo && export PATH=/tmp/lunate-media/bin-thinking:/tmp/lunate-media/bin:/usr/local/share/dotnet:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show
Type "lunate"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "What is the answer?"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "/quit"
Enter
Sleep 2s
